    <innerclass refid="class_cell_element" prot="public">CellElement</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_cell_element" kindref="compound">CellElement</ref> base class representing any patch-modifiable element within a terrain cell (moisture, resource, obstacle, etc.). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides the minimal interface and state required for elements that can be modified by patches. Each element stores a patch priority determining whether incoming patches are allowed to overwrite its current state. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
